"- de: German\n"
"- it: Italian\n"
"- pt: Portuguese\n"
"- nl: Dutch\n"
"- da: Danish\n"
"- sv: Swedish\n"
"- fi: Finnish \n"
"- zh-CN: Simplified Chinese\n"
"- zh-TW: Traditional Chinese"

