#: of readme_rosetta.markdown_handler.MarkdownHandler.protect_code_blocks:3
msgid "The Markdown text."
msgstr ""
"## Translating Markdown Text\n"
"### Rules and Guidelines\n"
"\n"
"1. Translating text from English to Finnish precisely.\n"
"2. Respond only with translated text, no explanations or notes.\n"
"3. Preserve Markdown formatting (headers, lists, bold, etc.) exactly.\n"
"4. Maintain original structure of the text, single sentence outputs required.\n"
"5. Return original text if unable to translate something.\n"
"6. Do not add new features, examples, sections, or information.\n"
"\n"
"### Example Usage\n"
"#### Translating a Single Sentence\n"
"\n"
"Original English: \"The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.\"\n"
"Translated Finnish: \"Nopea punertava kettu laskii yli lohikaa.\"\n"
"\n"
"#### Translating Multiple Lines\n"
"Original English:\n"
"```\n"
"# Header 1\n"
"## Subheader 1\n"
"- Item 1\n"
"- Item 2\n"
"## Subheader 2\n"
"### Item 3\n"
"```\n"
"Translated Finnish:\n"
"```markkuja 1\n"
"## Sisällyste 1\n"
"- Kohde 1\n"
"- Kohde 2\n"
"## Sisällyste 2\n"
"### Kohde 3\n"
"```"

